le you are talking about.","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.758,"parent_id":"1876214639257940464","conversation_id":"1876207243743662334"},{"id":"1876281447461650888","x":0.258066,"y":0.0,"t":1736175331,"iso":"2025-01-06T14:55:31.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"AdityaSameer0","author_id":"1678430933320634368","text":"@Md_YousuF_Ali I am very sorry to hear about your mother. 🙏\n\nWe were hit by the COVID 19 2nd wave, all three of us were in the same hospital room.\n\nMy mom was attached to an oxygen cylinder. My father is diabetic &amp; had heart surgery a few years ago. But it was my mom who was sicker than us.😔","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":4,"dt_root_h":4.914,"parent_id":"1876218686555799880","conversation_id":"1876207243743662334"},{"id":"1876310074194583716","x":0.35762,"y":0.0,"t":1736182156,"iso":"2025-01-06T16:49:16.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"Md_YousuF_Ali","author_id":"417200126","text":"@AdityaSameer0 I can feel the situation. 😔 \nMay God bless you and your parents. ❤️","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":6.81,"parent_id":"1876281447461650888","conversation_id":"1876207243743662334"},{"id":"1876316516456775930","x":0.380025,"y":0.0,"t":1736183692,"iso":"2025-01-06T17:14:52.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"AdityaSameer0","author_id":"1678430933320634368","text":"@Md_YousuF_Ali That day in the hospital when my mother was gasping for breathe on that horrible hospital bed I was scared. I felt like I was in hell. Irony is she's a doctor &amp; yet she suffered in front of my eyes and I didn't know how to help her.\n\nStill don't know why 3 of us survived COVID 19","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":7.237,"parent_id":"1876310074194583716","conversation_id":"187